  "Starting section as posted (8 cards, all counted): Set Your Course For Alderaan, Death Star, Death Star Docking Bay, Alderaan, Prepared Defenses, IAO, Mobilization Points, Crush The Rebellion. No starting Effect is named (Prepared Defenses deploys the three Effects).",
  "The list totals 61 cards as published.",
  "Posted 'Cloud City Docking Bay' dested Cloud City: East Platform (Docking Bay) because Platform 327 is a Light side site; East Platform is the Dark side Cloud City docking bay.",
