  "Posted 'IAO' (missed by the draft) dested Imperial Arrest Order; 'Dengar in ship' dested Dengar In Punishing One; 'Mara Jade [2]' dested Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'Vaders Saber' dested Vader's Lightsaber.",
  "Secret Plans is an Effect in 2001 (not a Defensive Shield).",
  "The strategy suggests swapping Dominator for Zuckuss in his ship; that card is not in the list."
